<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Request for Readmission</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  .header-logo {
    float: left;
    margin-right: 40px;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 16pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .form-section {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .form-label {
    width: 150px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .form-input-group {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .input-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    min-width: 100px;
    padding: 2px 0;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .committee-box {
    border: 1px solid black;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div class="header-logo">
      <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
      <div style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">UNIVERSITY OF SOUTH CAROLINA SUMTER</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-title">
      Request for Readmission by Removal of Academic Suspension
      <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 5px;">Submit Form to: Office of Admission Services</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Form Source: Office of Records and Registration</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">PLEASE PRINT CLEARLY.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Student Name</div>
      <div class="form-input-group">
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ first_name }}</span>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ last_name }}</span>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ middle_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Mailing Address</div>
      <div class="form-input-group">
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 100%;">{{ mailing_address }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Email</div>
      <div class="form-input-group">
        <span class="input-field">{{ email }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 300px;">Cell Phone</div>
      <div class="form-input-group">
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 150px;">{{ phone_number }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Last Term Attended:</div>
      <div class="form-input-group" style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
        <label><input type="radio" name="last_term" value="Fall"> Fall</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="last_term" value="Spring"> Spring</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="last_term" value="Summer I"> Summer I</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="last_term" value="Summer II"> Summer II</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Term to be Readmitted:</div>
      <div class="form-input-group" style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
        <label><input type="radio" name="readmit_term" value="Fall"> Fall</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="readmit_term" value="Spring"> Spring</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="readmit_term" value="Summer I"> Summer I</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="readmit_term" value="Summer II"> Summer II</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Year</div>
      <div class="form-input-group">
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50%;">{{ last_term_year }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 300px;">Year</div>
      <div class="form-input-group">
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50%;">{{ readmit_term_year }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Student Signature</div>
      <div class="form-input-group" style="width: 70%;">
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="student_signature">{{ student_signature }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>THE FOLLOWING QUESTIONS MUST BE ANSWERED ON A SEPARATE SHEET OF PAPER. PLEASE INCLUDE YOUR NAME AND VIPID ON EACH ATTACHED SHEET.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><span data-field="essay_question_1">{{ essay_question_1 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="essay_question_2">{{ essay_question_2 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="essay_question_3">{{ essay_question_3 }}</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="committee-box">
    <h3 style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">COMMITTEE USE ONLY</h3>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        <div class="form-label">Date</div>
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
        <div class="form-label">Columbia Approval</div>
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="columbia_approval">{{ columbia_approval }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 40px;">
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        <div class="form-label">Admissions Committee Signature</div>
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="admissions_committee_signature">{{ admissions_committee_signature }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
        <div class="form-label">Date</div>
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 40px;">
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        <div class="form-label">Associate Dean for Academics Signature</div>
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="associate_dean_for_academics_signature">{{ associate_dean_for_academics_signature }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
        <div class="form-label">Date</div>
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="date_3">{{ date_3 }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">
    If approved, the "Request for Academic Reinstatement/Suspension Removal" form should also be signed by the Associate Dean for Academic Affairs. Both forms are sent to the Registrar's Office for processing.
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 50px;">
    USC Sumter Records Office 5/16/14
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>